[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0077","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0296","title":"思科 ASA 自适应安全设备 路径遍历漏洞","description":"在思科 ASA（Adaptive Security Appliance）设备web界面中，存在严重的目录遍历（CWE-22）安全漏洞。该漏洞由HTTP URL输入验证不足导致，攻击者可通过精心构造的HTTP请求对文件_list.json等路径进行目录穿透访问，获取目标设备上的敏感系统信息。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用该漏洞，轻则导致设备意外重启引发服务拒绝（DoS）故障，重则可获取未经授权的系统信息。该漏洞影响众多思科产品，包括3000 Series Industrial Security Appliance (ISA)、ASA 1000V Cloud Firewall、ASA 5500/5500-X系列防火墙、ASA Services Module等一系列产品，同时也影响运行于这些设备上的ASA Software和Firepower Threat Defense (FTD) Software版本。攻击环境方面，该漏洞仅适用于IPv4和IPv6的HTTP协议访问，攻击条件较低，实际可利用性较高，相关CVSS评分7.5，危害等级为高。该漏洞最初披露于2018年6月7日，至今仍对许多企业网络设备构成潜在威胁，攻击者可借此获取设备配置、认证信息等敏感数据，最终可能演变为更高级别的系统控制攻击。Cisco已发布安全补丁更新，用户应及时安装最新版本以获取修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0296"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-07T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:30:25Z","remediation":"根据官方安全公告，应立即将受影响设备升级到支持的固定版本：对于Cisco ASA 9.1系列升级到9.1.7.29，9.2系列升级到9.2.4.33，9.3和9.5系列需迁移到9.4.4.18，9.6系列升级到9.6.4.8，9.7系列升级到9.7.1.24，9.8系列升级到9.8.2.28，9.9系列升级到9.9.2.1。对于FTD软件，6.0系列需升级到6.1.0 HotFix或更高版本，6.1系列需应用Cisco_FTD_Hotfix_EI-6.1.0.7-2.sh等特定补丁。由于该漏洞持续遭到实际攻击，因此不能采取临时缓解措施，必须立即应用这些安全更新以修复CWE-20/CWE-22路径遍历漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154017/Cisco-Adaptive-Security-Appliance-Path-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104612","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041076","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-184-01","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180606-asaftd","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44956/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0296","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47220","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-0296.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-0296.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ae7cbf60471587bdea4445c1578df6c016019acf/2018/CVE-2018-0296.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-0296.js","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/2e70acbeeef9696453f7c0f38d8e2b4509dfc29c/2018/CVE-2018-0296.json","https://github.com/bugbountywithmarco/bugbounty-disclosed-reports/blob/b6c76d1437e08a0ef77b7fbed612791c71cc4aa5/reports/377542_CVE-2018-0296.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2018-0296.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0296.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-0296.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-0296/poc/others/README.md","https://github.com/hackingyseguridad/directoriotraversal/blob/3063847ce7d77cf23fb34ea227288234eff6ce77/CVE-2018-0296.sh","https://github.com/yassineaboukir/CVE-2018-0296","https://github.com/milo2012/CVE-2018-0296","https://github.com/hackingyseguridad/directoriotraversal","https://github.com/bhenner1/CVE-2018-0296","https://github.com/qiantu88/CVE-2018-0296"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0178","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0178.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-3714","title":"node-srv 路径遍历漏洞","description":"node-srv 是一个 Node.js 静态文件服务模块，其 URL 路径处理存在路径遍历漏洞。由于未对用户请求的 URL 进行充分校验，攻击者可通过构造包含 ../ 等特殊字符的路径，绕过目录限制读取服务器上任意已知路径的文件内容。该漏洞影响所有使用 node-srv 模块的 Node.js 应用，攻击者只需具有网络访问权限且无需认证即可利用，导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-3714"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-07T02:29:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:57:42Z","remediation":"升级 node-srv 至最新版本 3.0.3，该版本已修复 URL 路径校验缺失问题。如无法升级，在应用层对用户请求的 URL 进行规范化校验，拒绝包含 `../` 或 `..\\\\` 等目录遍历序列的路径，并限制文件访问范围到指定根目录。建议迁移至其他活跃维护的静态文件服务模块（如 serve-handler）以长期规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://hackerone.com/reports/309124","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3714.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-3714.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3714.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-3714.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-3714-3546.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-3714-3540.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3714-3545.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3714-3541.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3714-3544.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-3714.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/high/CVE-2018-3714.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0059","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11709","title":"WordPress wpForo Forum 插件 反射型跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞","description":"标签包裹最终输出。<value>wpForo Forum 插件是 WordPress 的一款论坛插件。在 1.4.12 版本之前，该插件的 wpf-includes/functions.php 文件中的 wpforo_get_request_uri 函数未对用户提交的 URI 进行充分的输出编码与转义处理，导致存在未认证的反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者无需身份验证即可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL，诱使网站管理员或普通用户点击访问。一旦受害者打开该链接，恶意脚本将在其浏览器中执行，可导致用户会话劫持、网站后台凭据窃取、页面内容篡改或进一步发起钓鱼攻击等危害。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 wpForo Forum 插件的 WordPress 网站。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11709"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-04T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:24Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 wpForo Forum 插件升级至 1.4.12 或更高版本，升级后删除所有缓存并刷新 CDN。如暂时无法升级，可在 .htaccess 或防火墙规则中过滤包含 script、alert、onerror 等 XSS 特征的 URI 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.dewhurstsecurity.com/2018/06/01/wp-foro-wordpress-plugin-xss-vulnerability.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/wpforo/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9090","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11709.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11709.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9cba21fc4139363ce93df7e6ef55f0a6bcc365bd/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11709.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-11709.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11709-3197.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11709-3196.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11709-3199.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-11709.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-11709.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11709.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-11709.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0111","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11138","title":"Quest KACE System Management Appliance 命令注入漏洞","description":"Quest KACE System Management Appliance 8.0.318 产品中的`/common/download_agent_installer.php` 脚本存在安全漏洞，该脚本被匿名用户无需身份验证即可访问，并可被攻击者利用执行任意系统命令，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞的攻击条件极其简单，攻击者无需权限或用户交互即可触发，危害范围广泛，影响 Windows Server 等企业级设备，CVSS 评分高达 9.8，属于极端严重的安全漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送恶意请求，完全控制服务器，窃取敏感数据或破坏系统完整性。尽管微软等厂商随后发布了安全更新，但许多企业可能未及时更新，仍面临极大安全风险。该漏洞充分体现了 Web 应用中输入验证不足和参数清理缺失的危险后果，属于典型的命令注入类安全问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11138"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-31T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:35:19Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Quest KACE System Management Appliance最新安全补丁（至少8.0.400版本）以修复 `/common/download_agent_installer.php` 中的命令注入漏洞。同时，限制匿名用户访问该脚本权限，并配置Web应用防火墙规则阻止可疑的shell参数请求。 בנוסף，部署最新的网络入侵检测系统规则以监控针对此漏洞的攻击行为，并定期进行安全审计以确保补丁已正确应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.coresecurity.com/advisories/quest-kace-system-management-appliance-multiple-vulnerabilities","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44950/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-11138","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44950","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11138.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11138.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11138.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11138.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11138.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-11138.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-11138.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-11138.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-11138.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-11138.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-11138.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0050","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11133","title":"Quest KACE 系统管理设备 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Quest KACE System Management Appliance 8.0.318 的 '/common/run_cross_report.php' 脚本中 'fmt' 参数存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 fmt 参数值，诱导用户点击包含恶意脚本的链接，在受害者浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，可导致会话劫持、凭证窃取或代表用户执行操作。该漏洞影响 Quest KACE SMA 8.0.318 版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限但需要用户交互，影响范围扩大，机密性和完整性影响较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11133"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-31T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:35:18Z","remediation":"升级 Quest KACE System Management Appliance 到支持安全补丁的版本（8.0.318安全更新或更高版本），并在系统管理界面中启用XSS防护功能，禁用run_cross_report.php脚本的调试模式，同时对所有用户输入的'fmt'参数进行HTML实体编码和严格验证，并确保页面输出采用适当的内容安全策略（CSP）以阻止XSS攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.coresecurity.com/advisories/quest-kace-system-management-appliance-multiple-vulnerabilities","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11133.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11133.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11133.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11133.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-11133.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/quest/kace_system_management_appliance/CVE-2018-11133.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-11133.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-11133.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-11133.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11133.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-11133.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0056","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11473","title":"Monstra CMS 3.0.4 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Monstra CMS 3.0.4 注册页面存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 login 参数注入 JavaScript 代码，当受害者访问包含恶意载荷的注册页面时，脚本会在受害者浏览器上下文中执行。该漏洞源于 users/registration 路由对 login 参数缺乏输入验证与输出编码，攻击者无需权限即可发起攻击，但需诱导用户点击恶意链接（UI:R），攻击成功可窃取会话 Cookie、执行钓鱼攻击或篡改页面内容。受影响版本为 Monstra CMS 3.0.4，CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、需用户交互、范围改变、机密性/完整性低影响、可用性无影响。官方已在 GitHub Issue #446 中确认并修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11473"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-25T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Monstra CMS 3.0.5 或更高版本（如有维护分支），或手动修补 users/registration 页面的 login 参数输入过滤，使用 htmlspecialchars() 对用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码；若无法升级，请在 WAF 层面拦截包含 <script>、onerror、onload 等 XSS 特征的登录参数，并建议迁移至维护中的 CMS（如 WordPress、Ghost）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/monstra-cms/monstra/issues/446","https://github.com/nikhil1232/Monstra-CMS-3.0.4-XSS-ON-Registration-Page","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11473.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11473.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/66442328eb507ff4cc70a08b8d06ef2b17368786/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11473.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-11473.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-11473.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11473.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/monstra/monstra/CVE-2018-11473.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-11473.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-11473.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2018-11473.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-11473.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0053","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11231","title":"OpenCart Divido 插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"OpenCart Divido支付插件存在SQL注入漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可向插件的更新接口发送包含恶意SQL代码的特制POST请求，在数据库查询中注入非法语句，绕过数据库权限校验执行任意SQL查询。该漏洞影响所有安装并启用Divido插件的OpenCart电子商务网站，攻击成功后可窃取数据库中存储的敏感信息，包括用户个人信息、订单数据、支付凭证及管理员凭据等，进而可能导致整个系统的完全沦陷。攻击者只需知道目标站点的地址即可远程发起攻击，无需事先获取账号权限或进行复杂的交互操作，利用方式简单直接，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11231"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-23T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:35:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 OpenCart Divido 插件至最新修复版本（建议升级至 2.3.0.2 或更高版本），或直接禁用/卸载 Divido 支付插件。若暂无法升级，请在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面配置 SQL 注入防护规则，拦截包含 SQL 关键字（如 UNION、SELECT、SLEEP、BENCHMARK）的异常请求；同时在 OpenCart 后台启用 SQL 注入防护插件（如 OCMod 的 SQL Injection Protection 扩展）作为临时缓解措施，并限制数据库账号权限为最小权限原则（仅 SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE 必需表），禁止使用 root 账号连接数据库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://foreversong.cn/archives/1183","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11231.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-11231-3189.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/OpenCart/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11231.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/divido/divido/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11231.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-11231.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0032","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10095","title":"Dolibarr 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Dolibarr 在 7.0.2 版本之前存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于 `adherents/cartes/carte.php` 页面对 `foruserlogin` 参数的输入校验不足，导致远程攻击者可以通过构造特制的恶意 URL，在受害者的浏览器中注入并执行任意 JavaScript 脚本或 HTML 代码。攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取用户会话 Cookie、进行页面篡改或实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响所有低于 7.0.2 的 Dolibarr 版本，攻击条件为诱导用户访问含有恶意参数的链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10095"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-22T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Dolibarr 升级到 7.0.2 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可通过在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中配置过滤规则，拦截请求路径包含 adherents/cartes/carte.php 且 foruserlogin 参数中含有 HTML 标签或脚本字符的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2018/05/21/3","https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/blob/7.0.2/ChangeLog","https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/commit/1dc466e1fb687cfe647de4af891720419823ed56","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2018-05-21-cve-2018-10095-dolibarr-xss-injection-vulnerability/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10095.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10095.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10095.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-10095.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-10095-3160.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-10095-3158.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Dolibarr/CVE-2018-10095.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10095.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10095.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-10095.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-10095.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0777","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-4939","title":"Adobe ColdFusion远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2018-4939 漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Adobe ColdFusion 存在不安全反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），攻击者可利用该漏洞向目标系统发送特制的序列化恶意数据，在无需身份认证的情况下触发反序列化过程，从而在服务器上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Adobe ColdFusion Update 5 及更早版本以及 ColdFusion 11 Update 13 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8（严重级别），攻击条件宽松（网络可达、无需认证、无需用户交互），成功利用后可导致完全入侵受影响服务器。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-4939"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-05-19T17:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:59:19Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至 ColdFusion 2016 Update 6 或更高版本，或升级 ColdFusion 11 至 Update 14 或更高版本以修复反序列化漏洞。同时禁用不受信任的 Java 反序列化输入，并在部署层面启用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截可疑序列化对象请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103718","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/coldfusion/apsb18-14.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-4939","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-4939.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/89175b2ce75a8c340e9d987615810a87444e6d01/cves/2018/4xxx/CVE-2018-4939.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-4939.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-4939.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a14b63e8afc2a58338f509c08078b69c0cfe7fee/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-4939.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a14b63e8afc2a58338f509c08078b69c0cfe7fee/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-4939.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-4939","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-4939.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-4939.json","https://github.com/GrrrDog/Java-Deserialization-Cheat-Sheet/blob/a9d35815adcc5053862397362675ac105d1b976b/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0777.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0777.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0777.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0043","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10738","title":"Nagios Nagios XI SQL注入漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Nagios XI 在 5.4.13 版本之前的 admin/menuaccess.php 页面中，chbKey1 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞。未经充分身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该参数提交特制的 SQL 语句，在数据库层面执行任意查询操作。该漏洞影响所有部署了受影响版本 Nagios XI 的系统，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高。攻击者需具备高权限账户才能访问管理页面并利用此漏洞，成功利用后可导致敏感数据泄露、数据库篡改或进一步提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10738"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-16T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:36Z","remediation":"立即将 Nagios XI 升级至 5.4.13 或更高版本，以修复 admin/menuaccess.php 文件中 chbKey1 参数的 SQL 注入漏洞。升级前请备份配置文件与数据库。如暂时无法升级，应通过防火墙或访问控制列表限制对 /nagiosql/admin/menuaccess.php 的访问权限，仅允许可信管理 IP 访问该页面，并严格遵循最小权限原则，避免使用高权限账户进行日常运维操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.seebug.org/vuldb/ssvid-97268","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10738.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10738.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10738.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10738.yml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-10738.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Nagios XI/CVE-2018-10738.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/002f445c117788eccca176fc25679a0054ff81a3/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10738.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/nagio-cve-2018-10738.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10738.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/nagios/nagios_xi/CVE-2018-10738.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-10738/poc/xray/CVE-2018-10738.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0042","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10737","title":"Nagios XI SQL 注入漏洞","description":"Nagios XI 是一款广泛使用的网络监控管理系统。在 5.4.13 及之前的版本中，admin/logbook.php 页面的 txtSearch 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 SQL 查询语句绕过身份验证并获取数据库敏感信息。该漏洞需要具有管理员权限才能利用，攻击者需登录 Nagios XI 管理界面后向 logbook.php 的搜索功能发送包含 SQL 注入 payload 的请求，从而实现对后端数据库的未授权访问。受影响版本包括 Nagios XI 5.x 系列，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高。成功利用该漏洞可能导致攻击者获取配置信息、用户凭据等敏感数据，进而对监控系统造成进一步危害。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10737"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-16T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:36Z","remediation":"立即将 Nagios XI 升级至 5.4.13 或更高版本，该版本已修复 admin/logbook.php 中 txtSearch 参数的 SQL 注入漏洞。如暂时无法升级，建议通过 Web 服务器配置限制对 admin/logbook.php 的访问权限，或临时禁用 Logbook 功能模块作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.seebug.org/vuldb/ssvid-97267","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10737.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10737.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10737.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10737.yml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-10737.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Nagios XI/CVE-2018-10737.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10737.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/nagio-cve-2018-10737.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10737.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/nagios/nagios_xi/CVE-2018-10737.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-10737/poc/xray/CVE-2018-10737.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0041","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10736","title":"Nagios XI SQL注入漏洞","description":"Nagios XI 5.4.13 之前的版本（包括 5.2.x 及小于 5.4.13 的 5.4.x）中，admin/info.php 文件的 key1 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者需具备管理员权限，通过构造恶意的 key1 参数值向数据库发送恶意 SQL 查询，可获取敏感信息或篡改数据库内容。该漏洞影响 Nagios XI 监控平台，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10736"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-16T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:36Z","remediation":"建议将 Nagios XI 升级至 5.4.13 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。如暂无法升级，可临时移除或限制对 admin/info.php 页面的访问权限，仅允许可信网络地址访问，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中对该页面的 key1 参数进行过滤或拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.seebug.org/vuldb/ssvid-97266","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10736.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10736.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10736.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10736.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Nagios XI/CVE-2018-10736.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-10736.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10736.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/nagio-cve-2018-10736.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10736.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/nagios/nagios_xi/CVE-2018-10736.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-10736/poc/xray/CVE-2018-10736.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0040","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10735","title":"Nagios Nagios XI SQL注入漏洞","description":"Nagios XI 在 5.4.13 版本之前存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该漏洞位于 `admin/commandline.php` 接口的 `cname` 参数中，由于程序未能对用户输入的参数进行充分的过滤与转义，导致攻击者可以通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，在 `cname` 参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句。攻击者在拥有高权限账户（PR:H）的情况下，可利用此漏洞非法查询数据库敏感信息，甚至在特定配置下实现对系统的进一步控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10735"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-16T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Nagios XI 升级至 5.4.13 或更高版本以修复该 SQL 注入漏洞。在升级完成前，建议通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截针对 admin/commandline.php 接口中 cname 参数的异常 SQL 字符请求，或限制该管理接口的访问源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.seebug.org/vuldb/ssvid-97265","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10735.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10735.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10735.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/poc/nagio/nagio-cve-2018-10735.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Nagios XI/CVE-2018-10735.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-10735.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10735.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/nagio-cve-2018-10735.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/nagio-cve-2018-10735.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/nagios/nagios_xi/CVE-2018-10735.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-10735/poc/xray/CVE-2018-10735.yml","https://github.com/Yumeae/Bootstrap-with-XSS"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0181","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-5230","title":"Atlassian Jira Issue Collector 跨站点脚本漏洞","description":"Atlassian JIRA 的 Issue Collector 组件在自定义字段错误消息处理中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。当用户向自定义字段提交无效值时，系统未对错误消息中的用户输入进行充分过滤和转义，导致远程攻击者可通过构造特制的请求在错误消息中注入任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可触发该漏洞，但需要诱导目标用户访问包含恶意载荷的页面。成功利用后，攻击者可在受害者浏览器会话中执行任意脚本，窃取会话令牌、伪造页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞影响 JIRA 7.6.6 之前、7.7.0 至 7.7.4 之前、7.8.0 至 7.8.4 之前以及 7.9.0 至 7.9.2 之前的版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-5230"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-14T13:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:59:52Z","remediation":"升级 Jira 至 7.6.6、7.7.4、7.8.4 或 7.9.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面对 /rest/collectors/ 路径的请求添加输入过滤规则，拦截包含 <script> 等 HTML 标签的请求参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRASERVER-67289","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5230.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-5230.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-5230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5230-3559.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5230-3563.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5230-3564.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5230-3560.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-5230.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Jira/CVE-2018-5230.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medium/CVE-2018-5230.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0181.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0048","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10942","title":"PrestaShop Attribute Wizard 插件任意文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PrestaShop 的 Attribute Wizard 插件 1.6.9 版本中 `modules/attributewizardpro/file_upload.php` 文件存在不受限制的文件上传漏洞（CWE-434）。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过直接向服务器上传恶意的 `.phtml` 文件，绕过访问控制触发任意代码执行，导致服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响 PrestaShop 1.4.0.1 至 1.6.1.18 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10942"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-05-10T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:58Z","remediation":"删除或禁用 PrestaShop 的 Attribute Wizard addon (attributewizardpro) 模块，检查所有可能的目录变体（如 attributewizardpro、1attributewizardpro、attributewizardpro.OLD、attributewizardpro_x），直接删除 modules/attributewizardpro/ 整个目录；同时在该目录位置创建 .htaccess 文件，写入 \"RewriteEngine On\\nRewriteRule \\.(php|phtml|php5|pht)$ - [F]\" 阻止脚本执行；对所有文件上传功能实施白名单扩展名校验，禁止上传 .php/.phtml/.php5 等可执行文件；升级 PrestaShop 至官方最新版本以确保其他已知漏洞已修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://ia-informatica.com/it/CVE-2018-10942","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10942.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10942.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10942.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/attribute_wizard_project/attribute_wizard/CVE-2018-10942.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-10942.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-10942.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-10942.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-10942.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10942.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-10942_2.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c77